        "raw": "<p>We've got fun and games!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlague Rat, La Capitan, Ambuscade, Friction, and Sgt. Steel are the people that can find whatever they may need&nbsp;at the Nexus of the Void. Can Luminary, Chrono-Ranger, Guise, Omnitron-X, and X-Treme Argent Adept fight back, or will the the villains&nbsp;bring them to their shun-n-n-n-n-n-n-n-knees? Knees?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck heroes!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLate post but better than never I guess.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n~A-Kat</p>",
