        "raw": "<p>Fine after 4 tries I think? This one is owchy, lots of AoE damage flying around quickly. Even with Omni tanking as much as he could with the Ablative Coating, the heroes would drop too quickly.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFinally won with Luminary at 1hp via an extra power use to Death-Laser Steel before Luminary could be finished off. I think what finally worked for me was killing Ambuscade first to pull out the Nemesises (Nemesi? Nemesisisisises?) while Not-Pyro and Plague Rat could bring them down, followed by La Capitan, Plague Rat (Death-Laser #1), Friction, and finally Steel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n~A-Kat</p>",
